# ============================================================================
# Voyance — Edge Function Secrets (new project: qpwexpjqzsdkjkvgcntx)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. cp supabase/secrets.env.template supabase/secrets.env
#   2. Fill in each value (left of the # is the key; paste the secret after =)
#   3. Run:  supabase secrets set --env-file supabase/secrets.env
#   4. DELETE supabase/secrets.env afterward (it is gitignored, but don't keep it)
#
# Auto-provided by Supabase (DO NOT set): SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY,
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, SUPABASE_DB_URL
# Optional tuning flags with code defaults (set later if needed): DEBUG_LOGS,
#   PRICE_SANITY_ENABLED, TRACE_RECORDER_DISABLED, EXECUTIONER_GEO_DROP_ENABLED,
#   GOOGLE_DAILY_CALL_CEILING
# ============================================================================

